Modifications: this workflow adds a strict eight-second rejection and an API
exporting aligned binary PNG masks from actual SAM3 results. It does not export
overlay images as masks or alter source video colors.

The SAM3 model and weights have their own terms and gated access requirements:
https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam3
The application license does not grant model access or replace those terms.
